{"id": "DeVnOkWkSFJ", "title": "Video by anchorlinedigital", "description": "The US government just renamed AI. The tech inside didn't change one bit.\n\nOn Sept 29, Executive Order 14434 told federal agencies to use \"Super Intelligence\" and \"SI\" in place of \"Artificial Intelligence\" and \"AI\". On Oct 8, the President posted that anyone still saying \"Artificial Intelligence\" is \"THE ENEMY!\" One post about it hit 2.5 million views.\n\nThe catch: superintelligence already means something. It's AI smarter than humans at nearly everything, and nobody has built it. The order's own Section 3 defines SI as the same technologies \"encompassed by the term 'artificial intelligence'\".\n\nGus has relabelled his toaster. It still burns toast. 🍞\n\nSend this to the friend who still says AI.\n\nSources: Federal Register (EO 14434), White House, Politico, Axios, Poynter/PolitiFact.\n\n#artificialintelligence #superintelligence #AInews #techexplained", "channel": "anchorlinedigital", "uploader_id": "25349745254", "uploader": "Anchorline", "timestamp": 1791686645, "like_count": 19, "comment_count": 1, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/150.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-18121354420841255a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 70.057, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://scontent-ord5-2.cdninstagram.com/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQM3OY5RWXRCZ6PARyt6mWHFD6Z5qhOfEZ7pGfresOPao75fFxBNdaI95Xe2nOtCvbhG7Z8NxvXsasKng8GCqCeUUfCMZKmJIW4JMA4.mp4?_nc_cat=104&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.cdninstagram.com&_nc_ohc=uZbZyoa1X-oQ7kNvwGMXhWw&%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=xstQU1JUSGIt_M_gr6pFZQ&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQQGfauaK6IYSJL0E_9r